WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.360
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:08.880
No handing out instances of SCP-437 as&nbsp;
weaponry to unsuspecting new researchers.&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.720
Dr. Bright has a real taste for Mischief,&nbsp;
bloodshed, and root beer floats, or,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:17.360
as he calls them, the three major food groups.&nbsp;
New researchers at the Foundation, with their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.880
difficulty recognizing sarcasm, often find&nbsp;
themselves in the crosshairs of his goofier moods.&nbsp;

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.560
Well one of his cruelest jokes of all time,&nbsp;
however, is introducing new researchers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:31.760
to SCP-437 without any kind of warning.
Imagine starting a new job, and meeting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:36.160
someone of a higher rank than you that you think&nbsp;
you can trust. This person tells you to check&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.800
out a specialized weapon, and when you do, you&nbsp;
find trees that have disturbingly human faces in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.600
their bark, sap made from blood, and the muffled&nbsp;
sound of agonized screaming emanating from within.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.800
Dr. Bright has been formally censured&nbsp;
for this behavior, and warned that if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:53.120
it continues, he will be responsible for&nbsp;
covering all resulting therapy bills.

